{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>My Saved Places 是一款集中保存地址、座標與各類地點的工具，適合旅遊規劃、餐廳推薦、集合地點、停車位置及登山景點等需要日後再次尋找的場合；現時<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>，原價 US $0.99。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-48.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>集中管理所有地點</h2>\n<p>App 將地址、座標與推薦地點集中保存，可用 Apple 地圖搜尋或移動地圖大頭針記錄位置，並加入名稱及圖示。地點可整理成自訂清單或行程，支援搜尋與封存到訪地點；你亦可設定最多四個常用應用，透過 Apple Maps、Google Maps、Waze、Uber 或 Citymapper 等快速開啟同一目的地。無需帳戶，另支援可選 iCloud 同步及以 QR 碼在另一裝置開啟。</p>\n<figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1290x2796bb-12-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1181\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1290x2796bb-13-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1181\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1290x2796bb-14-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1181\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1290x2796bb-15-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1181\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1290x2796bb-16-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1181\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1290x2796bb-17-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1181\"/></figure></figure>\n<ul><li>應用名稱：My Saved Places</li><li>應用類別：Navigation</li><li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/my-saved-places/id6767223800?uo=4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li></ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-03T13:22:00.815379+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":350,"images":7,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-03T13:10:24+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-04T06:38:44.691016+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-03T13:19:04.720175+00:00","content_hash":"a2f6f82220bdf1302f00bd845ae21b240393a3a406bd6518baf46c74edbcd334","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}